# An impression of The Starry Night by Vincent van Gogh (public domain), issue 076: a walnut frame, a blue night sky of pale swirls, a yellow moon and stars, a dark green cypress on the left and a dark village below with a few lit windows. 32x16 wall slot.
size: 32x16
